3. Estimate
The estimated effort required to complete the project is 140 man-hours, distributed as follows:

- Development: 80 hours (front-end and back-end coding, UI/UX integration)
- Testing: 40 hours (unit tests, integration tests, user acceptance)
- Integration: 20 hours (authentication server integration, deployment in the client’s intranet)
4. Timeline
- Design Phase: 1st of September 2024 — 5th of September 2024
- Development Phase: 6th of September 2024 — 20th of September 2024
- Testing Phase: 21st of September 2024 — 27th of September 2024
- Integration & Deployment: 28th of September 2024 — 30th of September 2024
5. Support
We are committed to providing continuous support for the dashboard. This includes:

- Ongoing bug fixes and patches
- Support ticket system for reporting issues
- Development of new functionality as required
- Regular maintenance to ensure compatibility with updates to the client’s authentication server or telemetry systems.
